      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046842">(AVX512VL AND AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+245731"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046847">Converts 4 packed unsigned double-word integers from xmm2 into 4 packed unsigned byte integers in xmm1/m32 using unsigned saturation under writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
